      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a legacy though. it just feels like i'm standing in the middle of a wreck. everyone i used to trust is gone. i have no money, no career, and nowhere to go. the \"self-respect\" you're talking about doesn't pay rent or fill the silence in my apartment. i look at the world and all i see is this broken, corrupt mess that punishes the only people who actually care. i'm just exhausted. i'm so tired of fighting a system that's designed to crush you.",
